"kicad_raw_move_footprint tool — direct kipy writes bypassing the validated "
"config layer. Every call requires the expected board name "
"(expected_board_name) and refuses to write when a different board is open in"
" KiCad. Takes effect when the MCP server next starts. Same effect as the "
"KICADSTAMP_MCP_ALLOW_RAW_WRITE=1 environment variable."

