" this makes the cell reusable across Chains on different nets. Only needed "
"for ManualSpoke-reused cells — net_from_role cells need none of this. Can be"
" repeated. Fatal if the same net is also in --param/--net-template."
msgstr ""
"Write this via/track net as null instead of its literal name (e.g. '+3V3') —"
" at apply time a ManualSpoke-placed cell's via/track with net: null inherits"
" the enclosing Chain's own net (spoke_layout.py's 'via.net or rule_net'), so"
" this makes the cell reusable across Chains on different nets. Only needed "
"for ManualSpoke-reused cells — net_from_role cells need none of this. Can be"
" repeated. Fatal if the same net is also in --param/--net-template."

